Deprecated, removed in 2.0. Delete branch <NAME>. A later dream cycle removes the object if no ref names it.

Refuses to delete the current branch.

Usage: delete <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>
          Branch name to delete

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
